<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  telemetry:exempt static string resources, not a user-facing surface — a resource file has no
  user action and no error path. The screen's telemetry is wired in the @HiltViewModels in :app
  (WorkBoardViewModel / WorkBoardDetailViewModel).

  Work Board CHROME strings only: the screen title fallback, button labels, tile labels, the farm
  words for the server's fixed vocabularies (lanes, modules, work states, owner states) and the
  empty/loading copy the client owns. Every business sentence on a row (title, subtitle, pen label,
  park, clock label, owner name) is backend-owned and rendered verbatim.
-->
